<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>Why and When</title>
<style>
  body {
  font-family: 'Segoe UI', sans-serif;
  background-color: #f9f9f9;
  margin: 0;
  padding: 0;
}

.blog-post {
  max-width: 800px;
  margin: auto;
  padding: 2rem;
  background-color: #ffffff;
  box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);
}

.blog-post h1 {
  color: #3535b8;
  margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
}

.blog-post blockquote {
  background-color: #f0f4f8;
  padding: 1rem;
  border-left: 4px solid #3535b8;
  margin: 1.5rem 0;
  font-style: italic;
}

.comment-invite {
  margin-top: 2rem;
  font-size: 1.1rem;
}

/* Footer styling */
footer {
  background-color: #3535b8;
  color: white;
  padding: 1rem 0;
  text-align: center;
  font-family: 'Segoe UI', sans-serif;
  position: relative;
  bottom: 0;
  width: 100%;
}

.footer-container {
  max-width: 800px;
  margin: 0 auto;
}

@media (max-width: 600px) {
  footer {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
  }
}
</style>
</head>
<body>
  <%- include('partials/navbar') %>

  <article class="blog-post">
    <h1>Why and When: The Power of Timing</h1>
    <p><em>Published on November 25, 2025</em></p>

    <p>
      In the world of creativity and coding, timing is everything. Whether you're launching a new project,
      debugging a stubborn error, or presenting your ideas to the world — knowing when to act can make all the difference.
    </p>

    <p>
      This week, I reflected on how small decisions — like when to start a server, when to ask for feedback,
      or when to take a break — shaped the outcome of my work. I realized that success isn’t just about skill,
      it’s about rhythm. About listening to your intuition and trusting the process.
    </p>

    <blockquote>
      “The right moment doesn’t shout. It whispers. You just have to be quiet enough to hear it.”
    </blockquote>

    <p>
      I’ll be sharing more behind-the-scenes stories from my projects — from merging password tools to designing expressive layouts.
      If you’ve ever felt stuck or unsure, remember: the right time is often just a breath away.
    </p>

    <p class="comment-invite">
      💬 <strong>What’s your favorite moment of clarity?</strong> Drop a comment or share your story — I’d love to hear it.
    </p>
  </article>

  <%- include('partials/footer') %>
</body>
</html>